          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145788,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Con i pulsanti, i giochi reagiscono alle azioni del giocatore. Ad esempio, facendo clic su <em>Avanti</em> puoi scorrere gli sprite del giocatore.</p><p>Impareremo più avanti come scrivere quel codice. Per ora, ci concentreremo sull'elemento <code>button</code>.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   button {&#xA;    touch-action: manipulation;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body style=&quot;text-align:center;&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h3&gt;Choose Your Hero&lt;/h3&gt; &lt;img height=180 id=&quot;hero&quot;&#xA;   src=&quot;https://mimo.app/i/dan.png&quot;&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;button&#xA;   onclick=&quot;previous()&quot;&gt;Previous&lt;/button&gt; &lt;button&#xA;   onclick=&quot;next()&quot;&gt;Next&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   let currentIndex = 0;&#xA;   const images = [&quot;https://mimo.app/i/dan.png&quot;,&#xA;    &quot;https://mimo.app/i/jon.png&quot;&#xA;   ];&#xA;   &#xA;   function next() {&#xA;    if (currentIndex &gt;= images.length - 1) {&#xA;     currentIndex = 0;&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     currentIndex += 1;&#xA;    }&#xA;    document.getElementById(&quot;hero&quot;).setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, images[&#xA;     currentIndex]);&#xA;   }&#xA;   &#xA;   function previous() {&#xA;    if (currentIndex &lt;= 0) {&#xA;     currentIndex = images.length - 1;&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     currentIndex -= 1;&#xA;    }&#xA;    document.getElementById(&quot;hero&quot;).setAttribute(&quot;src&quot;, images[&#xA;     currentIndex]);&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145789,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per creare un pulsante su cui i giocatori possano fare clic, ci servono il tag di apertura <code>&lt;button&gt;</code> e il tag di chiusura <code>&lt;/button&gt;</code>.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;p&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"91\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Start your adventure!\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Start Game\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;button&gt;</code>, seguito da <code>&lt;/button&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145790,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo far apparire del testo su un pulsante scrivendolo tra i tag. Prova a scrivere <code>Play</code> tra i tag del pulsante.</p><p>Assicurati di usare una <code>\"P\"</code> maiuscola.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"106\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Arcade Arena\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h1\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Tap to jump into the action\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Play\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>Play</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145791,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In precedenza, hai imparato a enfatizzare il testo o a renderlo importante. Possiamo anche usare questi tag per il testo all'interno di un pulsante.</p><p>Prova a digitare <code>&lt;strong&gt;enter anyway&lt;/strong&gt;</code> tra i tag del pulsante.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"enter anyway\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"127\" endIndex=\"156\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Boss Fight\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"This level is difficult and may cause repeated defeat.\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"enter anyway\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"strong\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"button\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&lt;strong&gt;enter anyway&lt;/strong&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
